Team Reilly Group Rules


Communication

Check the group channel regularly so messages aren’t missed.
Use the group channel for team topics; use private chat for side conversations.
Be clear, respectful, and professional in all messages.
Respond within a reasonable time (ideally within 24 hours).


Collaboration & Workflow

Share files in the Team Reilly Group Chat so everyone has access.
Share work early, even if it’s not finished.
Keep track of decisions and changes so the team stays aligned.


UX & Feedback

Base decisions on user needs, not personal preference.
Give respectful, constructive feedback focused on improving the work.
Test and review work before submitting.


Responsibility & Timing

Stick to agreed deadlines.
Give advance notice if you’ll be unavailable or running late.
Communicate early if issues or blockers come up.
